          "body": "<style>\n        :root {--gray: #4A5568;--cyan: #06B6D4}\n        * {margin: 0;padding: 0;box-sizing: border-box}\n        body {font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;background-color: var(--gray);color: #e2e8f0;line-height: 1.7}\n        header {background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);backdrop-filter: blur(12px);position: sticky;top: 0;z-index: 200}\n        .nav-container {max-width: 1280px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 1rem 2rem;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between}\n        .logo {font-size: 1.75rem;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: -0.5px}\n        .nav-menu {display: flex;gap: 2.5rem;font-size: 0.95rem}\n        .nav-menu a {color: #e2e8f0;text-decoration: none;transition: color 0.3s ease}\n        .nav-menu a:hover {color: var(--cyan)}\n        .hero {display: flex;height: 85vh;min-height: 520px;background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gray) 0%, #2d3748 100%);position: relative;overflow: hidden}\n        .hero-content {width: 36%;padding: 6% 4% 6% 5%;display: flex;flex-direction: column;justify-content: center}\n        .hero-content h1 {font-size: 3.1rem;font-weight: 600;margin-bottom: 1.2rem;line-height: 1.15}\n        .hero-content p {font-size: 1.25rem;margin-bottom: 2.5rem;opacity: 0.92}\n        .cta {display: flex;gap: 1rem;flex-wrap: wrap}\n        .btn {padding: 0.95rem 1.75rem;border-radius: 6px;font-weight: 600;text-decoration: none;transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);display: inline-block}\n        .btn-primary {background: var(--cyan);color: #1e2937}\n        .btn-primary:hover {background: #67e8f9;transform: translateY(-3px);box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(6 182 212)}\n        .btn-secondary {background: transparent;border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;color: #e2e8f0}\n        .hero-right {width: 64%;height: 100%;background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(6,182,212,0.12));position: relative;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: flex-end;padding-right: 8%}\n        .visual {width: 380px;height: 380px;background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border-radius: 50% 50% 20% 20%;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: center;font-size: 2.5rem;opacity: 0.25}\n        main {max-width: 1280px;margin: 0 auto;padding: 5rem 2rem 4rem}\n        section {margin-bottom: 5rem}\n        h2 {font-size: 2.1rem;margin-bottom: 2.25rem;color: #f8fafc}\n        .plans {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 1.75rem}\n        .plan {background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);padding: 2.25rem}\n        .plan-header {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-start;margin-bottom: 1.75rem}\n        .plan-price {font-size: 1.85rem;font-weight: 600}\n        .plan-features {list-style: none;display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 0.9rem}\n        .plan-features li {padding: 0.65rem 0;font-size: 1.05rem}\n        .plan-features li::before {content: \"•\";color: var(--cyan);margin-right: 0.75rem}\n        .faq {background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius: 8px;padding: 2.25rem}\n        ol {counter-reset: question}\n        ol li {margin-bottom: 2.25rem;position: relative;padding-left: 2.75rem}\n        ol li::before {counter-increment: question;content: counter(question);position: absolute;left: 0;font-size: 1.35rem;font-weight: 700;color: var(--cyan)}\n        footer {text-align: center;padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;font-size: 0.9rem;opacity: 0.75;border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)}\n    </style><header>\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <div class=\"logo\">哦哦云</div>\n            <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n                <a href=\"#\">首页</a>\n                <a href=\"#\">套餐</a>\n                <a href=\"#\">功能</a>\n                <a href=\"#\">支持</a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n        <div class=\"hero-content\">\n            <h1>哦哦云</h1>\n            <p>提供稳定可靠的云端解决方案，助力高效流量管理和设备连接。</p>\n            <div class=\"cta\">\n                <a href=\"#plans\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">查看套餐</a>\n                <a href=\"#faq\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">查看FAQ</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hero-right\">\n            <div class=\"visual\">云</div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <main>\n        <section>\n            <h2>产品概述</h2>\n            <p>哦哦云专注于为用户提供安全稳定的云端网络技术。通过合理配置流量资源和节点选择，帮助个人与企业实现高效的在线连接与数据传输。</p>\n            <p>服务以简洁设计为基础，强调长期可靠性和易用性。无论日常浏览还是特定业务需求，均可找到匹配的方案。</p>\n        </section>\n        <section id=\"plans\">\n            <h2>套餐选择</h2>\n            <div class=\"plans\">\n                <div class=\"plan\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3>基础版</h3>\n                            <p class=\"plan-price\">¥15/月</p>\n                            <p>按年付仅需 ¥150/年</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                        <li>每月 100GB 高速流量支持</li>\n                        <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n                        <li>解锁基础流媒体平台</li>\n                        <li>普通线路节点池接入</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"plan\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n                            <p class=\"plan-price\">¥35/月</p>\n                            <p>按年付仅需 ¥350/年</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                        <li>每月 300GB 高速流量支持</li>\n                        <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n                        <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n                        <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n                        <li>7×24 优先工单支持</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"plan\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                        <div>\n                            <h3>团队版</h3>\n                            <p class=\"plan-price\">¥85/月</p>\n                            <p>按年付仅需 ¥850/年</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                        <li>每月 1000GB 高速流量支持</li>\n                        <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n                        <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n                        <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n                        <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq\">\n            <h2>常见问题</h2>\n            <ol>\n                <li>\n                    <h3>如何选择合适的套餐？</h3>\n                    <p>基础版适用于个人日常使用，旗舰版适合需要更多流量的用户，团队版则提供企业级的高带宽与定制支持。</p>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <h3>年付套餐的优惠机制是什么？</h3>\n                    <p>年付方式可降低整体费用，提供更长期的稳定支持，具体金额以页面展示为准。</p>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <h3>服务支持哪些设备？</h3>\n                    <p>兼容主流移动设备、电脑及智能终端，并针对常见平台进行优化。</p>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <h3>如何获得技术协助？</h3>\n                    <p>提供多渠道支持，包括在线工单与电话服务，专业团队将在工作时间内及时响应。</p>\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <h3>流量使用超出限制后会如何？</h3>\n                    <p>超出部分将按套餐规则自动管理，建议根据实际需求调整套餐等级。</p>\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer>\n        <p>© 2024 哦哦云 保留所有权利</p>\n        <p>本页面为静态演示用途，仅供参考</p>\n    </footer>",
